# Service and Data Rules

- Keep one source of truth for mutable business data.
- Avoid isolated module-level seed arrays for production flows.
- Keep service signatures stable; change internals first.
- Every successful mutation must update shared store and notify listeners.
- For local deploy mode, persist and hydrate data via `localStorage` with schema versioning.
- Remove TODO/demo-only paths from must-not-break flows before release.
